<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Ben Arthur" data-copy-zh="Ben Arthur">Ben Arthur</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Leather equipment, crafting and a one-time Intelligence lesson." data-copy-zh="皮革装备、礼物制作与一次性智力课程。">Leather equipment, crafting and a one-time Intelligence lesson.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">在哪里找到</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系节点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">常见卡点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Private-Client_Bookings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Community_Scene_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Crafting"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Meeting_Ben_and_Building_Affection"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Ben Arthur — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/ben-arthur.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Ben Arthur — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/ben-arthur.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Ben Arthur — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Ben Arthur is the cobbler to visit for leather equipment, a crafted gift and a one-time Intelligence lesson. Start with his shop rather than searching for a separate relationship destination.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Cobbler Shop: every day, 06:00–21:00. His introduction plays here once.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Current_Route_Limits_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Leather Boots and Leather Inlay each add one effective armor level and stack with each other. They do not replace paid armor upgrades. Boots need no money; the Inlay is the larger one-time commission.</p><p>For the stat lesson, reach Known (25) and Communication 68. It directly adds 14 affection and Intelligence +1; it is not a repeatable training service.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: personal and shared event navigation</summary><p>Each listed event happens once. Return to the named place after completing its prior steps. Completion affection is a base reward; dialogue choices can add further affection. The scenes and choice answers remain in the game.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base completion affection</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Cobbler Shop</th><td data-label="Requirements">Cobbler Shop; 06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Ben Arthur +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Mystery of Missing Herbs</th><td data-label="Requirements">General Goods Store; 18:00–21:00; Hailey Known (25); Kalb Acknowledged (10); Ben Arthur Acknowledged (10)</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Midnight Mystery</th><td data-label="Requirements">Secluded Sanctuary; 22:00–24:00 or 00:00–02:00; Jade Acquaintance (50); Aziza Known (25); Ben Arthur Acknowledged (10); Jade not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Time Capsule Discovery</th><td data-label="Requirements">Cobbler Shop; 09:00–18:00; Ben Arthur Acquaintance (50); Silas Known (25); Fernando Known (25); Jade Known (25); Jade not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Midnight Stargazer</th><td data-label="Requirements">Secluded Sanctuary; 22:00–24:00 or 00:00–03:00; Aziza Acknowledged (10); Ben Arthur Acknowledged (10)</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Evening Revelations</th><td data-label="Requirements">Exotic Goods Merchant; 19:00–21:00; Jade Friend (100); Ben Arthur Acquaintance (50); Jade not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Jade +5; Ben Arthur +5</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Musical_Performance_Reaction"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / usable start time</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / normal limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Ben Arthur</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Cobbler Shop; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Wisdom of Endurance</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Cobbler Shop; Known (25); Communication 68</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+14 direct affection; Intelligence +1; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Craft Leather Boots</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Cobbler Shop; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; 10 Leather</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">Leather Boots; +1 effective armor level; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Craft Moonfang Choker</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Cobbler Shop; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">0 min; 4 Void-Touched Fang; 4 Mutagenic Ichor; 5 Leather</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">1 Moonfang Leather Choker; repeatable</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Craft Leather Inlay</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Cobbler Shop; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; $100,000; 20 Leather</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">Leather Inlay; +1 effective armor level; once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The choker is a consumable gift, crafted from Infinity Dungeon drops and Leather. No time or money is charged by this crafting action.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: relationship bonuses</summary><p>Meeting each favorite-stat threshold adds 1 to ordinary base affection before the remaining relationship bonuses. The favorite skill doubles the adjusted base. Direct one-time affection rewards are added as listed.</p><p>Intelligence 45; Creativity 35; Technology 50</p><p>Favorite skill: Storytelling</p></details><p>Start windows exclude their ending hour. Listed time and resources are base values; applicable skills, difficulty and active bonuses can change the shown cost or affection. Base affection, direct affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>Already owning the Boots or Inlay removes the corresponding one-time commission.</li><li>Leather is required, rather than common crafting materials. Keep the Infinity drops for the choker if that gift is your goal.</li><li>Shared community events have their own places and hours; Ben Arthur’s shop schedule does not govern those events.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-combat-system.html">Armor and equipment</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-infinity-dungeons.html">Infinity Dungeon drops</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">Lessons and skills</a></li><li><a href="character-rose-arthur.html">Rose Arthur</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Private-Client_Bookings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Community_Scene_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Crafting"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Meeting_Ben_and_Building_Affection"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Ben Arthur 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/ben-arthur.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Ben Arthur 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/ben-arthur.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Ben Arthur 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Ben Arthur 提供皮革装备制作、礼物制作，以及一次性的智力课程。先去鞋匠铺与他交谈即可。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>在哪里找到</h2><p>鞋匠铺：每天 06:00–21:00；初次到访会触发介绍事件。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Current_Route_Limits_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>路线与关系节点</h2><p>皮靴和皮革内衬各增加 1 级有效护甲，效果可以叠加。皮靴无需金钱；皮革内衬则需要较高的一次性委托费。</p><p>属性课程要求已知（25）及沟通 68，完成后直接增加 14 好感度与 1 智力，仅能学习一次。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：个人与共同事件的触发条件</summary><p>下列事件均为一次性内容。完成前置后，请返回对应地点。完成好感度列为基础奖励，对话选择还可能追加好感度。剧情与选项答案请在游戏中体验。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">完成基础好感度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">鞋匠铺</th><td data-label="条件">鞋匠铺; 06:00–21:00</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Ben Arthur +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">失踪草药之谜</th><td data-label="条件">杂货店; 18:00–21:00; Hailey 已知 (25); Kalb 已遇见 (10); Ben Arthur 已遇见 (10)</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">午夜谜团</th><td data-label="条件">隐秘圣所; 22:00–24:00 或 00:00–02:00; Jade 相识 (50); Aziza 已知 (25); Ben Arthur 已遇见 (10); Jade 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">发现时间胶囊</th><td data-label="条件">鞋匠铺; 09:00–18:00; Ben Arthur 相识 (50); Silas 已知 (25); Fernando 已知 (25); Jade 已知 (25); Jade 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">午夜观星者</th><td data-label="条件">隐秘圣所; 22:00–24:00 或 00:00–03:00; Aziza 已遇见 (10); Ben Arthur 已遇见 (10)</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">夜晚的领悟</th><td data-label="条件">异域商品商人; 19:00–21:00; Jade 朋友 (100); Ben Arthur 相识 (50); Jade 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Jade +5; Ben Arthur +5</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Musical_Performance_Reaction"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／可开始时间</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／常规次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Ben Arthur 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">鞋匠铺; 陌生人 (0)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+1 基础好感度; 5次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">忍耐的智慧</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">鞋匠铺; 已知 (25); 沟通 68</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">30 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+14 直接好感度; 智力 +1; 一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">制作皮靴</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">鞋匠铺; 陌生人 (0)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; 10 皮革</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">皮靴；有效护甲等级 +1；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">制作月牙颈圈</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">鞋匠铺; 陌生人 (0)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">0 分钟; 4 虚触之牙; 4 异变灵液; 5 皮革</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">1 月牙皮颈圈；可重复制作</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">制作皮革内衬</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">鞋匠铺; 陌生人 (0)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; $100,000; 20 皮革</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">皮革内衬；有效护甲等级 +1；一次性</td></tr></tbody></table><p>项圈是以无限地下城掉落物和皮革制作的消耗型礼物。此制作行动不消耗时间或金钱。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：关系加成</summary><p>每达到一项偏好属性门槛，普通好感度计算的基础值增加 1；偏好技能会将调整后的基础值翻倍。标为直接好感度的一次性奖励按表中数值加入。</p><p>智力 45; 创造力 35; 科技 50</p><p>偏好技能：讲故事</p></details><p>开始时段不包含结束整点。表中耗时与资源为基础值；适用技能、难度及当前加成可能改变界面显示的消耗或好感度。基础好感度、直接好感度、玩家情欲经验与 NPC 亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>常见卡点</h2><ul><li>已有皮靴或皮革内衬时，对应的一次性委托会隐藏。</li><li>这些委托消耗皮革，不能用普通材料代替。制作项圈还需要保留指定的无限地下城掉落物。</li><li>共同社区事件有各自的地点与时段，不受他在鞋匠铺的日程限制。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-combat-system.html">护甲与装备</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-infinity-dungeons.html">无限地下城掉落物</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">课程与技能</a></li><li><a href="character-rose-arthur.html">Rose Arthur</a></li></ul></section>
